hyunjun: That's fair. That's completely fair. I'm going to cry at it tomorrow as well.
daniel: Most likely to make a schedule for the group chat.
@show songha neutral at=l
songha: I don't need you to point. I know.
> Everyone points anyway. Songha points at himself too, a little proudly.
@hide all
@show daniel smile at=c
daniel: Most likely to fall asleep before the game's over.
> Nobody needs to point. Charlie is already asleep, curled inside Fort Two, holding a tangerine.
@hide all
@show daniel neutral at=c
daniel: Most likely to leave first—
> He stops. It's too close to something. The rooftop goes quiet for half a second, and everyone is very carefully not looking at you.
daniel[smile]: No. Scratch that. New one. Most likely to *come back*.
> Eight fingers, one after the other, point at you.
* [sincere] Point at yourself too.
    @rel daniel trust+1
    @rel hyunjun trust+1
    @rel charlie trust+1
    > It feels like signing something. It feels like a promise that you want to keep.
    daniel[laugh]: Unanimous! First unanimous vote of the night!
